      "convo_id": "convo_6",
      "role": "user",
      "text": "I'm looking to buy a 3-bedroom house in the downtown area, budget around $400,000",
      "timestamp": "2025-07-01T10:02:00Z",
      "confidence_score": 0.88
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_028",
      "convo_id": "convo_6",
      "role": "assistant",
      "text": "Great! I found 12 properties matching your criteria in the downtown area. The average price for 3-bedroom homes there is $385,000, so you're right in the sweet spot. I can show you listings with modern kitchens, updated bathrooms, and some with parking included. Would you like me to email you the top 5 properties, or would you prefer to schedule a viewing tour with one of our agents this weekend?",
      "confidence_score": 0.9,
      "timestamp": "2025-07-01T10:03:00Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_029",
      "convo_id": "convo_6",
