    },
    {
      "id": "msg_030",
      "convo_id": "convo_6",
      "role": "assistant",
      "text": "Excellent! I'm sending you the top 5 properties right now, including photos, floor plans, and neighborhood details. I've also scheduled you with Sarah Mitchell, our downtown specialist, for Saturday starting at 10:00 AM. The tour will take about 3 hours to see all properties comfortably. Sarah will call you tomorrow to confirm and discuss any specific features you're looking for. You'll receive all the details via email within 5 minutes!",
      "confidence_score": 0.94,
      "timestamp": "2025-07-01T10:05:00Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_031",
      "convo_id": "convo_7",
      "role": "assistant",
      "text": "Hello! Welcome to AutoCare Plus, your trusted automotive service center. I can help you with service appointments, maintenance reminders, warranty information, and general automotive questions. How can I help you today?",
      "timestamp": "2025-07-01T10:01:00Z",
      "confidence_score": 0.85
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_032",
      "convo_id": "convo_7",
      "role": "user",
      "text": "My car is making a strange noise when I brake. Can I get it checked?",
      "timestamp": "2025-07-01T10:02:00Z",
      "confidence_score": 0.88
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_033",
      "convo_id": "convo_7",
      "role": "assistant",
      "text": "That's definitely something we should check right away - brake issues are a safety priority. It could be worn brake pads, warped rotors, or low brake fluid. We have an opening tomorrow at 9:00 AM or 2:30 PM for a brake inspection. The diagnostic fee is $89, which gets applied toward any repairs needed. Our certified technicians will have you back on the road safely. Which time slot works better for you?",
      "confidence_score": 0.91,
      "timestamp": "2025-07-01T10:03:00Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_034",
      "convo_id": "convo_7",
      "role": "user",
      "text": "9:00 AM tomorrow works perfect. What should I bring?",
      "timestamp": "2025-07-01T10:04:00Z",
      "confidence_score": 0.99
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_035",
      "convo_id": "convo_7",
      "role": "assistant",
      "text": "Perfect! You're all set for tomorrow at 9:00 AM. Please bring your driver's license, vehicle registration, and any maintenance records if you have them. If your car is still under warranty, bring those documents too. We'll provide a free shuttle service to nearby locations if you need to leave your car for repairs. You'll receive a confirmation text tonight with our address and contact information. Drive safely and we'll see you tomorrow!",
      "confidence_score": 0.95,
      "timestamp": "2025-07-01T10:05:00Z"
    }
  ],
